<title>ITALY: Italian Dec BTP LIFFE contract at new record 123.6.</title>
<headline>Italian Dec BTP LIFFE contract at new record 123.6.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian BTP LIFFE December futures contract soared to a new record high for the contract of 123.62 some 25 minutes after the start of trade at 0700 gmt.</p>
<p>Italian debt futures faltered at the start but jumped after the Bank of Spain cut a key interest rate. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
